 },
 "summary": "A single P-channel MOSFET on Vishay's TrenchFET process, in the DPAK (TO-252) surface-mount package with the drain on the tab. It blocks 60 V drain to source and carries 50 A continuous at a 25 °C case, a figure set by the package. On-resistance is at most 15 mΩ with -10 V on the gate and 20 mΩ with -4.5 V; the junction may run to 175 °C.",
 "key_figures": [
